# source: Taqvim synthetic iCalendar fixture for T-1003 exceptions — Gregorian weekly series with EXDATE, a moved and a cancelled RECURRENCE-ID instance, and a Taqvim Persian rule with RDATE, EXDATE and an overridden all-day instance; structure modelled on RFC 5545 and ADR-0013, contains no personal data
# url: https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5545
# retrieved: 2026-09-15
# reviewer: pending
# notes: synthetic; exercises RFC 5545 §3.6.1, §3.8.1.11, §3.8.4.4, §3.8.5.1, §3.8.5.2, §3.8.8.2
